  "2026-10-22T13:59:49.565Z",codex-agent,"New PR #5 review round at f359b79: worktree is clean, remote head pulled, main is already an ancestor, and prior completed fixes are retained. Two new unresolved findings are valid: PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6vNsYU allows semantic merge suggestions despite a recorded supersession; PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc6vNsYh classifies all embedding POST 400 errors as durable document rejection. Latest CodeRabbit review has no outside-diff findings. Plan: exclude recorded supersession pairs regardless of age ordering; recognize only explicit HTTP 400 input-length errors while retaining 413 input handling and strict model/protocol failure policy. Add real non-git tracker regressions, independently revert each changed function, review all pair/error consumers, and run unchanged npm/Bun release gates."
